cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "LAUREN: Lower And Upper Real-time Electrojet iNdices"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: DiMarco
    given-names: Connor C.
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0706-4309
    affiliation: University of Michigan
abstract: >-
  A machine-learning corrector that turns GeoDGP real-time ground magnetic
  perturbation predictions into Kyoto-style AU and AL auroral electrojet
  indices in real time, including a short-range forecast from the L1
  solar-wind transit lead. Trained on 18 years (2005-2022) of GeoDGP reruns
  driven by MIDL solar wind; validated fully prospectively on 2023-2024.
keywords:
  - space weather
  - auroral electrojet
  - AU index
  - AL index
  - machine learning
  - real-time forecasting
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-10
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/connordimarco/LAUREN
